; Applied by build.py while it stages the mod into P:\temp\_stage\<ModName>\;
; it is NOT passed to AddonBuilder (-exclude= crashes AddonBuilder 1.0.240639).
; Files matching these patterns are not staged, so they stay out of the PBO.
; Each pattern matches the whole path relative to the mod root, ignoring case,
; and '*' crosses folders, so 'folder\*' also drops files with no extension.
; Comment lines start with ';'.

; Sprite sources for /dayz-build-imageset. Only the packed .paa atlas and
; .imageset under gui/imagesets/ ship; the source PNGs stay out of the PBO.
.gui-sources\*
*\.gui-sources\*

; Workbench project files (dayz.gproj, DayZSetting.xml) are for the editor, not the game
workbench\*
*\workbench\*

; Workbench plugins (scripts\editor\plugins\*.c) run only in the mod's gproj;
; the game never loads them, so they stay out of the PBO. '*' crosses folders.
scripts\editor\*

; Binarization by-products and backups
*.dep
*.log
*.rpt
*.bak

; Source, doc and temp folders at the mod root only, archives, image sources.
; These stay anchored to the root: the patterns match case-insensitively, so
; an unanchored *\Temp\* would also drop scripts\4_World\Temp\ or data\doc\.
Source\*
Temp\*
Doc\*
*.zip
*.7z
*.psd

; Version control
*\.svn\*
*\.git\*
.svn\*
.git\*
*.scc

; Nested packed files, editor temp files, signatures and keys
*.pbo
*.ebo
*.biedi
*.bisign
*.bikey
*.biprivatekey
